@baseUrl = http://localhost:8325
@userId = expo-user-001
@deviceId = expo-device-001

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 获取默认设置
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 更新设置
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "bedtime": "23:00",
  "wakeTime": "07:00",
  "persona": "gentle",
  "reminderStyle": "gentle",
  "defaultGuidance": "breathing_46",
  "whiteNoiseDurationMin": 20
}

### 获取今晚状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 模拟闭仓
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"simulate_box_closed"}

### 开始倾诉（可省略；首轮 turn 会从 LOCKED 自动进入 CONVERSATION）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"start_conversation"}

### 第一轮倾诉
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/turn
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"text":"明天要做工作汇报，我有点紧张。","inputMode":"text"}

### 提前结束倾诉
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/finalize
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 选择引导
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"select_guidance","guidance":"breathing_46"}

### 获取最近 7 张记忆卡
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journals?limit=7
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 上报设备开仓事件
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{$uuid}}",
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "type": "box_opened",
  "payload": {}
}

### 领取设备命令（没有命令时 204）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/commands/next?deviceId={{deviceId}}&timeoutSec=1

### 模拟晨光开始
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"simulate_alarm"}

### 模拟贪睡
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"snooze"}

### 标记起床
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tonight/actions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User-Id: {{userId}}

{"action":"mark_awake"}

### WebSocket（使用支持 WebSocket 的 HTTP 客户端）
WS {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ws?userId={{userId}}
